{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25877","headline":"莺莺歌 · 李绅","name":"莺莺歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯劳飞迟燕飞疾，垂杨绽金花笑日。\n绿窗娇女字莺莺，金雀娅鬟年十七。\n黄姑上天阿母在，寂莫霜姿素莲质。\n门掩重关萧寺中，芳草花时不曾出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}